ession\" â€” the lane's skill auto-loads once, greets once, no repeating-prompt loop.\n\n- **Branding/runtime facts:** presented as a **Ghost World Labs** tool \"Powered by NextGen Nuclear â˜¢\"; one declared native-dependency exception (`pywinpty`, lazy, terminal-only); host is the desktop `PUTER`/`gwl-server`.\n\nOne caveat worth flagging: these claims are grounded in `CLAUDE.md` and the frozen plan docs (which state v4 is built/merged), not re-verified against the live running code this turn â€” let me know if you want me to confirm any specific claim against the source."}],"stop_reason":null,"stop_sequence":null,"stop_details":null,"usage":{"input_tokens":2,"cache_creation_input_tokens":4410,"cache_read_input_tokens":45311,"cache_creation":{"ephemeral_5m_input_tokens":4410,"ephemeral_1h_input_tokens":0},"output_tokens":2,"service_tier":"standard","inference_geo":"not_available"},"diagnostics":null,"context_management":null},"parent_tool_use_id":null,"session_id":"a8c450f4-bfef-460e-bb8b-9e545c317fd5","uuid":"3963e86a-e6ce-41f3-aa36-f3b5567536af","request_id":"req_011Cc1JZm6hAGefyquWBf2hU"}
